# Environment files hold secrets (database URLs, signing keys, API tokens): never commit them.
# Only the documented templates are tracked. packages/goldsky/{dev,prod}.env are tracked pipeline
# settings without secrets; .gitleaks.toml and CI scan every commit for anything that slips through.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

